  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "\"Oh... isn't that nice.\" She smiles. \"You must be very successful.\"",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaNotFleet [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "You explain that you found Scylla on Laicalle Habitat and helped her initiate a very important project at the Galatia Academy.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "With Zal's assistance, Scylla helped Provost Baird develop a method to open the Gate System.\r\n\r\nIt was a high-pressure project, and dangerous. Not for her, of course. Her job was on the theory and numbers side. Adonya nods, an extra wrinkle of concern on her forehead.\r\n\r\nIt didn't quite work out as expected, you explain, however you did manage to make history by using the so-called Janus Device to traverse the Gates, the first such trip in over 200 cycles. And it was made possible through Elissa Zal's engineering based on theoretical developments by Academician Scylla Coureuse.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell2 [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "\"Oh!\" Adonya lights up at your words. \"I'm so happy she found Elissa again, what a nice girl. A little strange, though. Always up to something. But that's my Scylla.\"\r\n\r\n\"I think she gets her taste from me,\" Adonya says in a  conspiratorial half-whisper.\r\n\r\n\"You should have met her father! You'd have liked him, I think. Stars above, he could be a troublemaker. But he was fun,\" she nods to herself.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell3 [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "\"Oh, okay,\" she says.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell4a [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "\"Oh, okay,\" she says, unconcerned.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell4b [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "\"Oh,\" she says, apparently unconcerned. \"Good luck.\"",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell4c [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "\"Thank you for stopping by, captain. I know you must be very busy and an old woman's worries are probably the last thing on your mind, but it was good of you to take the time.\"\r\n\r\nShe pauses for a moment. \"If you find her, tell her she could send comms more often. I do so love hearing from her.\"",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaTell5 [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "\"Of course,\" she says. \"Scylla is a good daughter.\"\r\n\r\n\"Sometimes it's a long time between them, and I get worried.\" She glances back toward her holotainment unit. \"It'd be nice if she came for a visit.\"",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaMoreHolos [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "\"Now you be careful out there,\" she says. \"I know you're young, but you're not immortal. And I heard on the holo all about these terrible pirates who...\"\r\n\r\nHer impression of what happens between the Fringe and Core is somehow both ridiculously exaggerated and entirely insufficient. The holo-networks of Fikenhild are famously more entertaining than informative.\r\n\r\nEventually you manage to extract yourself from the comms-link.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaOut [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "\"I know, dear, you already mentioned it,\" she says.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaImportantToFind [text]"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "\"Of course it is,\" she says, humoring you. \"It's always the fate of the worlds with Scylla, isn't it?\"\r\n\r\n\"I know this is all very important to you, captain.\" Her voice takes on a more incisive tone. \"But if she's hiding from someone, if she's hiding from you, I'm sure it's for a good reason. And like I told Mister Siyavong when he came by, I don't know where my daughter or Elissa are - and I wouldn't tell him if I did.\"\r\n\r\nShe crosses her arms.",
   "ctx": "data/campaign/rules.csv adonyaImportantToFind2 [text]"
  },
